+The positive integer `d+e` decreases at each subtraction, so the process ends.
+At its counterexample endpoint neither degree divides the other. Writing
+
+```text
+d=mD,    e=nD,    gcd(m,n)=1,
+```
+
+then has `m,n>1`: `m=1` would say `d|e`, and `n=1` would say `e|d`.
